  "raw_label": "appellant_lost",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mandar Rajendra Thosar vs State Of Maharashtra on 30 January, 2024 Author: Sarang V. Kotwal Bench: Sarang V. Kotwal 2024:Bhc-As:5105 Gokhale 1 of 4 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No. 3385 Of 2022 Mandar Rajendra Thosar ..A Versus State of Maharashtra ..R ______ Mr. S. K. Ali a/w. Shabi Fatma a/w. Asif Ali a/w. Pratibha Gupta i/b. A. A. Siddiquie & Associates for Applicant. Ms. Mahalakshmi Ganapathy, App for State/Respondent. ______ Coram : Sarang V. Kotwal, J. Date : 30 January 2024 P.C. : 1.",
    "facts": "The police had intercepted a tempo bearing Mandar Rajendra Thosar vs State Of Maharashtra on 30 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/94363034/ 1 No.MH12/LT-1609 carrying banned food articles containing tobacco and pan masala. The tempo was searched and the banned food articles namely scented tobacco, pan masala etc. worth Rs.5,58,000/- was seized. Out of them, Anil Dhepe was the driver. Therefore, the applicant is apprehending his arrest.",
    "arguments": "He is not connected with the arrested accused. She submitted that, in the present application, the applicant was protected by ad-interim order."
  },
